		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ebon-winged, four-armed gargoyle fiend born from an ancient nabasu demon. 15 feet tall but bird weight.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 47, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 black daggers +7 (2d4 + drain) or 1 maddening howl, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Drain</strong>. CHA 15+ or 1d6 WIS damage, dies and becomes juju zombie at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Maddening Howl</strong>. All mortals within double near that hear, WIS 15+ or confused 1d4 rounds (d8): 1-3. Do nothing, 4-5. move in random direction, 6-7. attack nearest creature, 8. flee.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
